<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Privacy Policy | BeautyTrend Daily</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for BeautyTrend Daily." />
    <!-- Favicon -->
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <style>
      :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: #faf8f7;
        color: #202020;
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }
      .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }
      .header { background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding: 16px 20px; }
      .logo { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #111; text-decoration: none; }
      .logo span { color: #d65d7a; }
      .content-box { background: #fff; padding: 40px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid #eee5e2; }
      h1 { font-size: 32px; margin: 0 0 16px; color: #111; }
      h2 { font-size: 20px; margin: 24px 0 10px; color: #111; }
      p { margin: 0 0 16px; color: #555; }
      .back { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #d65d7a; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="header">
      <div style="max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
        <a href="/" class="logo">BeautyTrend<span>Daily</span></a>
        <a href="/" style="color: #666; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;">← Home</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
      <a href="/" class="back">← Back to Home</a>
      <div class="content-box">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Last updated: October 2026</p>
        <p>
          At BeautyTrend Daily (accessible from beautytrend-daily.pages.dev), one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information collected and recorded by BeautyTrend Daily and how we use it.
        </p>
        <h2>Log Files & Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          BeautyTrend Daily follows standard log file procedures. We may use privacy-respecting analytics to understand site traffic and improve reader experience.
        </p>
        <h2>Cookies & Advertising</h2>
        <p>
          Third-party partners and advertising networks (such as Google AdSense) may use cookies to serve ads based on user visits to this and other websites on the internet.
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
